OL,3,GNEWSAMan finally freed from prison
OL,4,Ahoused miles from home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a man released from
OL,7,Fprison after 21 years says she feels
OL,8,Fshe has "lost him again" after he was
OL,9,Fhoused in temporary accommodation miles
OL,10,Ffrom home.
OL,12,FLuke Ings, 38, from Bracknell, was
OL,13,Ffreed last month after judges quashed
OL,14,Fan indefinite sentence he was given as
OL,15,Fa 17-year-old in 2006.
OL,17,FBut his reunion with his family was
OL,18,Fshort-lived as he has been housed in
OL,19,Feast London, because there was
OL,20,Freportedly nowhere appropriate in his
OL,21,Fhometown.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
