OL,3,GNEWSAMan finally freed from prison
OL,4,Ahoused miles from home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ministry of Justice (MoJ) spokesman
OL,7,Fsaid: "Prison teams assess every
OL,8,Fprisoner's needs before release,
OL,9,Fworking with local services to help
OL,10,Fsecure housing and other support."
